                         TCP STATES

                           LISTEN
                              |
                              | SYN
                              ▼
                         SYN-SENT
                              |
                              |
                         SYN-ACK
                              |
                              ▼
                      SYN-RECEIVED
                              |
                              | ACK
                              ▼
                         ESTABLISHED
                              |
                              | FIN
                              ▼
                    FIN-WAIT / CLOSE-WAIT
                              |
                              ▼
                          LAST-ACK
                              |
                              ▼
                         TIME-WAIT
                              |
                              ▼
                           CLOSED

The exact state path depends on which
endpoint initiates the connection or termination.
